    question: "Can older Downtown Issaquah homes support a Level 2 charger?",
    answer: "Many pre-1970 homes in Olde Town have 60-amp or 100-amp electrical services. A panel upgrade to 200 amps is typically required before installing a 40A or 48A EV charger. Our electricians perform a complete NEC Article 220 load calculation to determine exact requirements for your home."
  },
